From e38b592ff64dc1b89bc37baa6e533e678d95e257 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:42:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Close the period: Master Mapping_<period>.csv +
 ucc_<period>_enriched.csv from the reviewed mapping

New Outputs-step block and POST /runs/{id}/finalize. Applies pending
approvals, writes the reviewed mapping with the period suffix, then joins
it back onto the run's UCC file on the matcher's key (state pair +
upper-cased name) and appends SECP_NAME_MAPPED, Firm_ID and
mapping_source to every filing - all raw rows and columns kept, unmapped
filings left blank. Folder picker added to the Tauri shell.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K5M7FnXPWrv7D7XYUXLqa1
